EREQ4 REQ4 0 VALUE={V(REQCOMMON)*V(PERMIT4)}
XCL4 IMON4 ILIM TRIP4 COT_CURRENT_LIMIT PARAMS: VLOGIC=5
XSHOT4 REQ4 TRIP4 GATE4 READY4 COT_ONESHOT PARAMS:
+ TON={TON} TOFFMIN=100n VLOGIC=5
XDRV4 GATE4 GH4 GL4 COMPLEMENTARY_DRIVER PARAMS:
+ VLOGIC=5 DEAD=20n
XPH4 IN OUT GH4 GL4 SW4 IMON4 BUCK_PHASE PARAMS:
