XCL6 IMON6 ILIM TRIP6 COT_CURRENT_LIMIT PARAMS: VLOGIC=5
XSHOT6 REQ6 TRIP6 GATE6 READY6 COT_ONESHOT PARAMS:
+ TON={TON} TOFFMIN=100n VLOGIC=5
XDRV6 GATE6 GH6 GL6 COMPLEMENTARY_DRIVER PARAMS:
+ VLOGIC=5 DEAD=20n
XPH6 IN OUT GH6 GL6 SW6 IMON6 BUCK_PHASE PARAMS:
